sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Clerk as Front-Desk Clerk
    participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
    participant BFF as BFF / API Gateway
    participant OPD as OPD Module
    participant PEP as PEP Middleware
    participant Cerbos as Cerbos PDP<br/>(sidecar)
    participant EMPI as EMPI Service
    participant DB as OPD Database
    participant Bus as Event Bus

    Clerk->>FE: Enter patient details
    FE->>BFF: POST /opd/patients (Bearer JWT)

    Note over BFF: Verify JWT signature<br/>via JWKS (cached)
    BFF->>BFF: Signature valid, not expired

    BFF->>OPD: Forward request + JWT

    Note over OPD: Identity adapter verifies<br/>JWT independently (zero-trust)
    OPD->>OPD: Construct Principal from claims<br/>(user_id, iq_tenant_id, roles, dept)

    OPD->>PEP: Intercept before business logic
    PEP->>Cerbos: CheckResources over loopback gRPC
    Note over PEP,Cerbos: Principal: {clerk, roles:[front_desk]}<br/>Resource: {kind: opd:patient}<br/>Action: register

    Cerbos->>Cerbos: Evaluate: base tenant isolation<br/>→ resource policy → scoped policy
    Cerbos-->>PEP: EFFECT_ALLOW

    PEP->>OPD: Proceed to business logic

    OPD->>EMPI: SearchPatient(name, DOB, phone)
    Note over EMPI: Dedup check — exact match<br/>on (name, DOB, phone)

    alt Patient exists
        EMPI-->>OPD: Matched patient (EMPI ID)
        OPD-->>FE: 200 OK (existing patient record)
        FE-->>Clerk: Patient already registered (show record)
    else New patient
        EMPI->>EMPI: Create canonical patient record
        EMPI-->>OPD: New EMPI ID

        OPD->>DB: Create OPD registration<br/>(EMPI ID, iq_tenant_id, visit details)
        DB-->>OPD: Registration saved

        OPD->>Bus: Publish patient.registered event
        Note over Bus: Consumed by downstream modules<br/>(billing, queue management, audit)

        OPD-->>FE: 201 Created (registration + EMPI ID)
        FE-->>Clerk: Registration confirmed
    end
